WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.010
Claude asks two questions

00:00:01.010 --> 00:00:02.010
On the question, press RET to open it in a buffer of its own

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:02.680
Press 1 to choose Emacs for the first question

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:04.360
Press 1 and 2 to toggle Elisp and Python for the second

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:05.700
C-c C-c sends the answers, and the turn finishes
